00:01:51.134 --> 00:01:52.186
- In inference.

00:01:52.186 --> 00:01:53.019
- I love this.

00:01:53.019 --> 00:01:54.503
- Oh right, this was in London.

00:01:54.503 --> 00:01:55.916
- Did they freak out?

00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:57.750
- Yeah, they made a lot of noise.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.190
- I would've lost my mind.

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:02.130
