00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:04.542
But it was wonderful.

00:02:04.542 --> 00:02:06.150
They ran a double-header

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.170
of "The Mummy," "The Mummy Returns."

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:11.010
